","text":"詳細はコチラ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.joqr.co.jp/nogizaka/2015/03/328-46.html"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、来てねっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジェットコースター乗りたいなあ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山、キレイだもんね(﹡ˆ﹀ˆ﹡)ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現在発売中のグラビア ザ テレビジョンさんで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりんが私のことを「猫みたい」って言ってるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫は猫でも、例えると自分は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のら猫だと思う。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自由にフワッと生きてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから多分、自分を動物に例えても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野生そう。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飼い主とかいないんだろうなあ。気ままに放浪してそう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー野生のさゆが現れた！ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"習性"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく寝て、よく食べて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時々、突拍子もない行動をとったりもする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事のときはスイッチが入ってるけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフのときはあんまり目が開いてない。(　³ω³ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとうとうとしてる。寝子。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いのがとても苦手。とにかく。"},